    "intro_html":  "Rendang is what happens when curry stops being soup and becomes a rich, clingy, caramelized coat of coconut and spice on tender chicken. It takes patience, not skill. Each bowl delivers \u003cstrong\u003e41 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.80\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), which is a steal for one of the great dishes of Southeast Asia.",
